<main><section class="page-hero"><p class="eyebrow">IMPORTANT INFORMATION</p><h1>Health disclaimer.</h1><p>Clear information helps people make informed decisions.</p></section><section class="section"><div class="info-card"><h3>General information</h3><p>Information on this website is provided for general educational and wellness purposes. It is not a substitute for diagnosis, treatment, or advice from a qualified healthcare professional.</p><h3>Products</h3><p>Product descriptions should not be interpreted as guarantees of treatment, cure or prevention. Follow the manufacturer's directions and seek appropriate professional advice, especially if you are pregnant, taking medication, managing a diagnosed condition, or experiencing serious or persistent symptoms.</p><h3>Emergencies</h3><p>Do not use this website or WhatsApp as an emergency medical service. For an emergency, contact appropriate emergency services or go to a suitable healthcare facility.</p><h3>Availability and prices</h3><p>Product availability and prices can change. Confirm current information with Profound Health Care before ordering.</p></div></section></main><footer class="footer"><div class="footer-main"><div><a class="brand" href="../index.html"><img src="../products/imgs/mylogo.png" alt=""><span>PROFOUND HEALTH CARE<small>Uyo, Akwa Ibom</small></span></a><p>Health, wellness, beauty and personal care.</p></div><div><h4>Explore</h4><a href="../services.html">Services</a><a href="../products.html">Products</a><a href="../index.html#about">About</a><a href="../index.html#contact">Contact</a></div><div><h4>Contact</h4><a href="tel:+2349042539204">+234 904 253 9204</a><a href="https://wa.me/2349042539204" target="_blank">WhatsApp</a><span>Uyo, Akwa Ibom</span></div></div><div class="footer-bottom"><span>© 2026 Profound Health Care. All rights reserved.</span><span>Health information is general education, not a diagnosis.</span></div></footer><a class="floating-wa" href="https://wa.me/2349042539204" tar